    - target: {fileID: 8365984140137022275, guid: 4524c014f7461fa46af879a9f1f57eb1, type: 3}
      propertyPath: characterName
      value: Shawn Mc. Stabby
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8365984140137022275, guid: 4524c014f7461fa46af879a9f1f57eb1, type: 3}
      propertyPath: multipleLines.Array.size
      value: 6
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8365984140137022275, guid: 4524c014f7461fa46af879a9f1f57eb1, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'multipleLines.Array.data[0]'
      value: Hey, wanna do a lil sum for me?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8365984140137022275, guid: 4524c014f7461fa46af879a9f1f57eb1, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'multipleLines.Array.data[1]'
      value: The guards took my precious knife I spent so long makin after I stabed
        a fool who was actin so tuff.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8365984140137022275, guid: 4524c014f7461fa46af879a9f1f57eb1, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'multipleLines.Array.data[2]'
      value: Now that I don't got a means of defence I need a replacement.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8365984140137022275, guid: 4524c014f7461fa46af879a9f1f57eb1, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'multipleLines.Array.data[3]'
      value: Inside the kitchen ovah there past that locked door they should have
        enough knives for me to stab everyone here.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8365984140137022275, guid: 4524c014f7461fa46af879a9f1f57eb1, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'multipleLines.Array.data[4]'
      value: Now I need you to get in there somehow and grab me one of them knives
        and I'll give you this key to the infirmary.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8365984140137022275, guid: 4524c014f7461fa46af879a9f1f57eb1, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'multipleLines.Array.data[5]'
      value: Sound like a deal?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
